PULSE
Launch Readiness & Phase-Gate Memo
Prepared by: Vasanth Raj
Date: May 2026
1. Objective

This document outlines the current operational status, phased validation framework, readiness gates, and progression criteria for PULSE.
The purpose of the current phase is to validate operational reliability, supplier adoption, workflow stability, and infrastructure scalability in a controlled environment before progressing into broader enterprise deployment.
The rollout approach is intentionally staged to ensure:
Controlled rollout
Operational learning
Risk-managed progression
Product stabilization before scale
Legal and compliance alignment
Clear success and escalation criteria before enterprise expansion

